### Login ✅
POST http://192.168.1.13:8000/api/v1/users/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@gmail.com",
  "password": "customer"
}

# ===================================================================================
# ===================================================================================
# ===================================================================================

### Vendor: Create Product ✅
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vendor_token}}

{
  "name": "Product X",
  "price": 19.99,
  "details": "A new product"
}

# ===================================================================================
# ===================================================================================
# ===================================================================================


### Customer: Add Item to Cart ✅
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/carts/items
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

{
  "product_id" : 1 ,
  "quantity" : 5
}


@item_id=3
### Customer : Update Item in Cart ✅
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/carts/items/{{item_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

{  
  "quantity": 3
}

@item_id_to_delete=1
### Customer : Delete Item from Cart ✅
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/carts/items/{{item_id_to_delete}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}


# ===================================================================================
# ===================================================================================
# ===================================================================================

@cart_id=2
### Customer: Checkout ✅
POST http://192.168.1.13:8000/api/v1/carts/{{cart_id}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

{
  "delivery_address": "Some random address"
}


### Customer: Cancel Order ✅
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/orders/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

{
  "order_id": 2
}


@order_id=1
### Vendor: Post Delivery Request ✅
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}/publish
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vendor_token}}


# ===================================================================================
# ===================================================================================
# ===================================================================================


### Delivery: Request to Deliver ✅
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/delivery-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{delivery_token}}

{
  "order_id": 1
}

@delivery_request_id=1
### Vendor: Accept/Decline Delivery Request
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/delivery-requests/{{delivery_request_id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vendor_token}}

{
  "status":"approved"
}


# ===================================================================================
# ===================================================================================
# ===================================================================================


### Delivery: Pickup Order
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/orders/pickup
Authorization: Bearer {{delivery_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "order_id" : 1
}


### Delivery: Mark Delivered
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/orders/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{delivery_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "order_id" : 1
}